            "notes": "Try to use your Biotic Orb for healing most of all, it's fine to use it in a duel where you need to burst, otherwise in a sustained duel where you are fighting against a full HP opponent, healing is still better and more reliable.\n\nYour #1 priority is always healing, but if you see a squishy, then try to use your primary on them. Don't waste your primary healing, as it expires pretty easily in Round 1.\n\nAnother best time to use damage Biotic Orb is when you want to kill combo with your ultimate.\n\n [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)  is very high value and you proc it very fast - 2500 for 1000. I've had ultimate ready sometimes 30 seconds after round start.",
